{"author_date": "2024-08-04T23:16:43Z", "author_login": "Sbozzolo", "commit_date": "2024-08-05T00:27:29Z", "committer_login": "Sbozzolo", "message": "Do not specialize on CairoMakie\n\nMakie has multiple backends. Each backend loads the Makie package. Previously,\nClimaAnalysis provided an extension for one particular backend, now, the\nextension was generalized and it should work for any backend.", "sha": "1d205e17609f11dde2e09941784e8b3dc1b99e83"}
{"author_date": "2024-08-15T23:20:48Z", "author_login": "ph-kev", "commit_date": "2024-08-16T00:46:24Z", "committer_login": "ph-kev", "message": "Add Utils.split_by_season\n\nThe function split_by_season is in ClimaCoupler and should be moved to\nClimaAnalysis. Also, the package Dates is added as a dependency\nbecause split_by_season operate on dates. Finally, the workflow is\nupdated to also include Dates in Downgrade.yml.", "sha": "5ec768ae7fc45cfdc4560c0431e256452060229f"}
